WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.8 · Marketing & Communications
Content strategy and editorial calendar

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Plan content around a few themes and the time you really have alongside everything else.

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:27.393
A content strategy decides what you will publish, for whom, why and how often. An editorial calendar plans that content a few weeks ahead, so you are ready for key moments like your launch.

4
00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:28.393
Pillars, calendar and reuse

5
00:00:28.393 --> 00:00:38.611
Content pillars: Three to five recurring themes linked to your objectives and messages. For example: Our bakery: why we started, behind the scenes, trainees’ bakes, order now.

6
00:00:38.611 --> 00:00:50.311
Editorial calendar: Date, channel, pillar, message, format and owner, planned a few weeks ahead. For example: Week 1, Tuesday: a trainee’s loaf on the bakery’s channel, posted by the sales founder.

7
00:00:50.311 --> 00:01:01.730
Batching and reuse: Make content in batches and adapt one piece across several channels. For example: One launch-day video becomes a post, a newsletter item and a poster.

8
00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:02.730
Why it matters

9
00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:08.033
1. Planning ahead prepares you for your launch and key moments.

10
00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:12.226
2. Pillars keep content tied to your objectives.

11
00:01:12.226 --> 00:01:17.048
3. Batching saves a founder’s scarce time.

12
00:01:17.448 --> 00:01:18.048
What it plans for

13
00:01:18.048 --> 00:01:22.241
1. Your launch, first sessions, seasons and deadlines.

14
00:01:22.241 --> 00:01:26.063
2. Your social media, newsletter and website.

15
00:01:26.063 --> 00:01:32.367
3. Your reviews: adjust the mix as you learn what works.

16
00:01:32.767 --> 00:01:33.367
What to avoid

17
00:01:33.367 --> 00:01:37.930
Planning more than the time you really have.

18
00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:41.381
Starting every piece from zero.

19
00:01:41.381 --> 00:01:46.944
Leaving no room for news you cannot plan.

20
00:01:47.544 --> 00:01:49.344
You define your content pillars and draft your first month.

21
00:01:49.344 --> 00:01:53.344
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

22
00:01:54.844 --> 00:01:57.944
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
